        "speaker": "actor",
        "speaker_label": "折川皐月",
        "actor_id": "nurse_satsuki",
        "text": "「七号床的患者，术前检查都完成了。她说自己不是想取消手术，只是希望有人告诉她，接下来什么时候会来接她。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "outfit": "uniform",
        "hide_portrait": false,
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_001",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "sat0_002",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
